#dialogue-block("Misty Olszewski", "She's still alive? Thank heaven, V. Seeing that medical batch code and transport slip proves we aren't too late... Keep the updated codex file and catch your breath; as soon as we trace who signs the NOX-9 batch, we go after Lucía.")
